  "description": "*“Today, all demons in the world will vanish.”*\n\nThe Continental Magic Barrier, humanity’s final trump card to end the century-long war against the demons. Pat, a hero, and Noah, an imperial mage, were dispatched to carry out this mission. Together with Loro, a young shepherd boy they met at their final destination, they finally find themselves on the verge of completing this grand plan. And on that day, everything changed.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
